\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSideConditionModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingSideConditionModel}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义；第三参数为成员语言码)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}side\\text{-}condition\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSideConditionModel}_S(M,\\theta,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\exists H_\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(H_\\theta),\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}side\\text{-}condition\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingSideConditionModel}_S(M,\\theta,\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\\exists H_\\theta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(M),\\mathfrak M_{\\in}(H_\\theta),\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S(M)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>两侧现在调用规范成员结构编码及上游三元初等子结构谓词；裸二元组不再被当作满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a> 编码合同的一阶结构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locati